{'symbol': 'AMT', 'date': '2022-10-25 07:00:00', 'title': 'NEW ARTIFICIAL INTELLIGENCE RESEARCH FINDINGS SHOW ACCELERATION IN DATA CENTER DEPLOYMENTS', 'text': 'DENVER--(BUSINESS WIRE)--CORESITE, A LEADING HYBRID IT SOLUTIONS PROVIDER AND SUBSIDIARY OF AMERICAN TOWER CORPORATION (NYSE: AMT) (“AMERICAN TOWER”), TODAY ANNOUNCED THE RELEASE OF THE NEW RESEARCH REPORT “ARTIFICIAL INTELLIGENCE: CHARTING THE WAY FORWARD FOR AI: 2022 SURVEY OF IT LEADERS AND SERVICE PROVIDERS ON AI DEPLOYMENT” IN COLLABORATION WITH THE MARKET RESEARCH AND COMPETITIVE ANALYSIS GROUP HEAVY READING AND ERICSSON.'}